flowchart TD
    Start([User writes]) --> Detect{Trigger fires?<br/>. ? ! / idle / enter}
    Detect -->|Yes| Mode{Current Friction Mode}
    Mode -->|Socratic - default| S1[All engines active<br/>full cooldowns<br/>Devils Autocomplete disabled]
    Mode -->|Coach - moderate| C1[Cooldowns relaxed ~50%<br/>phrase accept via typing]
    Mode -->|Assistant - light| A1[Cooldowns relaxed ~75%<br/>Tab-accept enabled<br/>Interceptor only blocks<br/>write the whole thing]
    S1 --> Guard
    C1 --> Guard
    A1 --> Guard

    Guard{Non-Generation Contract<br/>isGenerationAllowed<br/>Hard invariant ALL modes}
    Guard -->|Output is 3+ declarative<br/>sentences OR >60 words| Block[BLOCKED<br/>Return refusal / Socratic question]
    Guard -->|Output is a question,<br/>verdict, or short scaffold| Allow[ALLOWED<br/>Persist Intervention]
    Allow --> Render[Show wavy underline<br/>+ popover]
    Block --> Render

    Note[Note: friction relaxes<br/>cadence & accepting help,<br/>NEVER the non-generation contract]
